      "value": "Modifying Crafted Spells"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "After I've made a spell, if I have any modifiers on it, I can tinker with the focus a little bit to change those values "
        },
        {
          "text": "(Hold the GUI modifier key and activate the spell)",
          "italic": true
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nI can use the Ritual of Alteration to add modifiers to an existing spell.\n\nI should pay attention to how complex I make the spell with these modifiers though, I can only manage so much.  At least, for now."
        }
      ]
    }
